The user will ask something like: "I need to prepare internal financial materials. Our company Riverfront Logistics has $1.5M cash, 6 months runway, burn rate $72K/month, and revenue last quarter $1.8M. Can you help me with customer ac..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


